OL,3,GNEWSATip toy donation point to gather
OL,4,AChristmas gifts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group is hoping to open a toy
OL,7,Fdonation point at a tip to stockpile
OL,8,Ffree gifts for families ahead of
OL,9,FChristmas.
OL,11,FThe Darlington Toy Exchange was started
OL,12,Fby Macauley Macdonald and his partner
OL,13,Fin November 2025 and they gathered
OL,14,Fhundreds of donations.
OL,16,FTheir toy exchange stall has continued
OL,17,Frunning in Darlington Indoor Market but
OL,18,Fthe couple hope a new point at the
OL,19,Ftown's tip will give them "a big head
OL,20,Fstart" ahead of the festive period.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
