OL,3,GNEWSATip toy donation point to gather
OL,4,AChristmas gifts
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe group is asking businesses to help
OL,7,Ffind a suitable metal or plastic shed
OL,8,Fto function as a donation point and
OL,9,Fplans to open in early September.
